<opsproc code="00009121.0001001" revdate="2024-05-22T17:28:48"><title>Yellow System Electric Pump</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.021"><title>ONE ENGINE TAXI</title><procbody lid="N.00009121.0001001.023"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.024"><para code="00009121.0001001.010" layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.025">During
one engine taxi, the <abb>PTU</abb> pressurizes the yellow hydraulic
system and generates noise in the cockpit and the cabin.</para></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.004"><title>On ground</title><procbody lid="N.00009121.0001001.005"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00009121.0001001.002" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.006" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If the pump continuously runs and does not stop when set to
off:</intro><procbody lid="N.00009121.0001001.007"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.008" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009121.0001001.003"><challenge><tech-label type="cb">DOORS/CARGO (T12 on 122 VU)</tech-label></challenge><response>Pull</response></cr-action></action><condition at-any-time="false" code="00009121.0001001.004" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.009" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If unsuccessful:</intro><procbody lid="N.00009121.0001001.010"><action-block lid="N.00009121.0001001.011"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.012" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009121.0001001.005"><challenge><tech-label type="cb">Y HYD/ELEC PUMP/NORM (AB 03 on 123 VU)</tech-label></challenge><response>Pull</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.013" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009121.0001001.006"><challenge><tech-label type="cb">Y HYD/ELEC/PUMP (AB 06 on 123 VU)</tech-label></challenge><response>Pull</response></cr-action></action></action-block></procbody></condition><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.014"><noteproc code="00009121.0001001.007" layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.015"><numlist code="00009121.0001001.008" format="NNP" layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.016"><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.017">If the pump
continuously runs on the ground, there is a potential overheat situation.</para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009121.0001001.020">The reset of
